      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0071",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-05820-s001",
      "sentenceText": "One day, I got a call and followed the same routine.",
      "sentenceSha256": "27e08b518d129e46ee6ad74e8b91d68eda9f33b00a3421b029d95f694f5d3a8d",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-05820-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-041",
      "parentFingerprint": "bb4cf7f88c6d59313ee1e6a63252e643936944f44f75e6fbcc4d9af045c70e76",
      "passageSha256": "9e27417878c6977e47873a755725d3966b0697a922509a10bc2690f6b39d003c",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0072",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I repeated, “H-I-S-F-A-T-H-E-R?”",
      "sentenceSha256": "cb8f2742bf8db073dc67bb731ef88ea57f97219866bf4b2a8d8b81d11ea04682",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "83390d7b274df6840743756b6bbfc2d8f3021bcefc5cdfa3a6b53596a6aca438",
      "passageSha256": "b51b3e092df27ad92f1726f27e3c2720683154dc9b81c6ac963f4227cb6a9454",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0073",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s002",
      "sentenceText": "“Yes.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "838a04296799794f4e1a85c40540fd52027a3aa3d6a1cd735f69b489839212cf",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-042",
      "parentFingerprint": "83390d7b274df6840743756b6bbfc2d8f3021bcefc5cdfa3a6b53596a6aca438",
      "passageSha256": "b51b3e092df27ad92f1726f27e3c2720683154dc9b81c6ac963f4227cb6a9454",
      "pdfPages": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0074",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s005",
      "sentenceText": "I didn’t realize until I put down the phone that it was Mike’s father!",
      "sentenceSha256": "4f6bac1389d1b64253a21becdd6e625affa982564c3ee3856d8aacd414c5c386",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "988982fddcaa42db68ff430f30d519f5e0cacd0d5787cc000f645bc9a2e95b5b",
      "passageSha256": "8624b3a6c93e28bb8133f32de739194cf5dd7bad3ded41b6f362b0d1abf3e430",
      "pdfPages": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0075",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s008",
      "sentenceText": "My listening comprehension of English was very low at that point.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2f5e9e30018a974089b9c10808cb586d57449f15b088e1447bfae0214b911170",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-043",
      "parentFingerprint": "988982fddcaa42db68ff430f30d519f5e0cacd0d5787cc000f645bc9a2e95b5b",
      "passageSha256": "8624b3a6c93e28bb8133f32de739194cf5dd7bad3ded41b6f362b0d1abf3e430",
      "pdfPages": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0076",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s009",
      "sentenceText": "It was humiliating.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ca95186790e8c8569551644f4c866977c313f9c93964ea151701adde108b6986",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "37daa82d8bb425b0566a091a4b59d0899ee0a612ddb759fc0474545b6b1f6284",
      "passageSha256": "647872304df2eea8710159eb18aa1667042914e6e8f49b3ed5b9daed9ebaffab",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0077",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-s010",
      "sentenceText": "Indeed, I had never been more humiliated.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3d17827a4fcdbf7828ca312c179c0bd90cd62f32f71b613c44ff7dbf6c122097",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p049-06210-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-044",
      "parentFingerprint": "37daa82d8bb425b0566a091a4b59d0899ee0a612ddb759fc0474545b6b1f6284",
      "passageSha256": "647872304df2eea8710159eb18aa1667042914e6e8f49b3ed5b9daed9ebaffab",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0078",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-01725-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Of course, I also had a lot of awesome experiences while studying abroad, like going to Acadia National Park and Martha’s Vineyard, where I saw rocky beaches and lighthouses for the first time.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c0078d39b74520f525ade74b58d054585d79b0f43e8b3b31ba30a1eb5029430d",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-01725-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "270198618ee9a69cb3ce73d09ed6014b2f7c6f6a75d79e36d73de012c68f8f5f",
      "passageSha256": "a4c110942559b206e9b37b207fad962c18c774d74d608aee72a6fc0248496775",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0079",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-01725-s004",
      "sentenceText": "Traveling abroad as a tourist is also novel and interesting, but as a tourist you rarely have authentic interactions with locals.",
      "sentenceSha256": "521ff3c80360180880265f54ea6d1686783754d1410b329201661fd7cfc86be2",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-01725-r004-006",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "b84f44dbe822c25abd12995c6d1b660c085bb6c46c6c1dccc828f3079f8fd7d7",
      "passageSha256": "8729b9070b249a8b3f59bb283b0171ba3051d196ca4dc4f85774d24a3e0b20f3",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0080",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-04065-s001",
      "sentenceText": "With this in mind, Jaime Kurtz and I recruited students studying abroad one semester, as well as students who were interested in studying abroad but had stayed on campus.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7fc1ac093c34a0053f5a0b88146e0c18feec0a27bc7304c0416c6934146e6201",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-04065-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "5ac9ce24734d881ab39443c8761d6112dd57bf8f6d285cc47fcc9d8b7bf6e855",
      "passageSha256": "44d7e0d5603048674880ddc5cf73c7032ae2faf73b4cf91ef842d23b57cdfce8",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0081",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-04065-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Every week, participants abroad and on campus completed a brief survey similar to the daily diary survey described earlier in the chapter.",
      "sentenceSha256": "06c6935980d0a1446a8bc81259e72ba5eec06b3109ea728dfa709f4c8ecb5a01",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-04065-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "5ac9ce24734d881ab39443c8761d6112dd57bf8f6d285cc47fcc9d8b7bf6e855",
      "passageSha256": "44d7e0d5603048674880ddc5cf73c7032ae2faf73b4cf91ef842d23b57cdfce8",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0082",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-s001",
      "sentenceText": "How come?",
      "sentenceSha256": "efe0b5d7c4664576693a6558e8d26f3dbec5030c97e11dc756d83b97b92f0398",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "8cdd06e032658e23aad22bd376ab8ec1c62ae2bb83decaf827fff14cee5f43a2",
      "passageSha256": "447aa67ac878d0ac7975412020523e958895f5b077cb5d70f2f81e7af2d912e4",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-s002",
      "sentenceText": "We looked deeper into the weekly reports and found that study abroad students were far more likely to engage in artistic activities (e.g., going to concerts and museums), shop, party, and take short trips.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6ff9e3a33d7ebe21ef5caa22dd400cc8df51ba743d14f8b9e2988e6307208331",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "8cdd06e032658e23aad22bd376ab8ec1c62ae2bb83decaf827fff14cee5f43a2",
      "passageSha256": "447aa67ac878d0ac7975412020523e958895f5b077cb5d70f2f81e7af2d912e4",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-s003",
      "sentenceText": "They were far less likely to engage in club meetings, sporting events, video games, or volunteer activities than on-campus students.",
      "sentenceSha256": "13fbbdc45053d0b9a3f6c04b58bdc1df27a738caf705f12db97027769859ef1e",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c05-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "8cdd06e032658e23aad22bd376ab8ec1c62ae2bb83decaf827fff14cee5f43a2",
      "passageSha256": "447aa67ac878d0ac7975412020523e958895f5b077cb5d70f2f81e7af2d912e4",
      "pdfPages": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c05-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-s005",
      "sentenceText": "The other activities were not ultimately associated with psychological richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0ff7ccc88170cfe9b6f18d3e093e2905eda1147f5e9e1b1ed1ffe5b1a33bc1e3",
      "readingUnitId": "c05-s04-p050-05820-r005-006",
